["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うすい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">薄；厚度小；淡；浅；微弱；稀薄的；寡淡；微弱；不浓；渺茫；微弱；可能性低；稀疏；零散；不密集</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224899\">コーヒーは<ruby>薄<rp>(</rp><rt>うす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのが<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我想我的咖啡虚弱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄暗い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うすぐらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">昏暗；阴暗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121396\"><ruby>薄暗<rp>(</rp><rt>うすぐら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かりで<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んではいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你不该在这么差的光线下看书</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うすめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">稀释；冲淡；变淡；减弱（如颜色、味道、浓度等）；缓和；削弱；淡化；调和（如言辞、印象、效果等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">漩涡；旋涡；涡流；漩流</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">埋まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うずまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被埋；被覆盖；被包围；拥挤；充满；被偿还；被补足；被填补；被填满；（日程等）被排满</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うそ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谎言；谎话；虚言；错误；失误；不明智之举；错误决策；不可能！；难以置信！；真的吗？！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227962\">えっ<ruby>嘘<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でしょ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哦,我的上帝,我不能相信这一点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嘘つき</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うそつき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">说谎者；骗子；说谎；撒谎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193757\">もし<ruby>嘘<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なら、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はうそつきだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果这是假的,她是一个骗子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">歌曲；歌唱；古典日本诗歌（尤指短歌）；现代诗歌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186791\"><ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がうまければいいのになあ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我希望我是个好歌手</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歌う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うたう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">唱；歌唱；歌咏；用诗歌表达；吟诵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215403\">ジョンはステージで<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">约翰在台上唱了甚么歌？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/397001\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うたがう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怀疑；不信任；猜疑；怀有疑心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196384\"><ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>言葉<rp>(</rp><rt>ことば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をまだ<ruby>疑<rp>(</rp><rt>うたが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っているんですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你还在怀疑我说的话吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\"