\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宇宙；宇宙空间；太空</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189885\"><ruby>宇宙<rp>(</rp><rt>うちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>限<rp>(</rp><rt>かぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">宇宙没有极限</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">団扇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うちわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团扇；圆扇（日本传统手持扇子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76567\">ちなみに、この<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>冷房設備<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぼうせつび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なんて<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。あるのはうちわだけ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">另外，这间房里面没有冷气设备之类的东西，有的只是一把团扇。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1941168\" title=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">内訳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うちわけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">(费用等的)明细；项目；分类；详细情况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123214\"><ruby>内訳<rp>(</rp><rt>うちわけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどのようにしましょう？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你喜欢这些东西吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">うっかり<